id: cli/status-err
name: the loud ask
prose: the ask goes through status to the queue; a refused connection and an unparsable url both print the exact error line and exit one
claims:
- src/bin/rjq-cli.rs:1-24
covers:
- R1
- R2
rows:
- run: ./target/debug/rjq-cli redis://127.0.0.1:1/ q x
  expect:
    rc: 1
    out: |
      err Connection refused (os error 111)
- run: ./target/debug/rjq-cli garbage q x
  expect:
    rc: 1
    out: |
      err Redis URL did not parse
